            // the streaming column); the single-column LOB terminals keep the map-less path below.
            // suppressMapper is requested by the CSV terminal, which reads the columns from the reader
            // itself: no Func<IDataRecord, TResult> is compiled (no TResult per row), and unlike the
            // sequential-access LOB path it does not turn on SequentialAccess (so SQLite keeps its
            // projection unchanged and MySQL/MariaDB/ClickHouse stay on the buffered behavior).
